  "title": "Adam Smith",
  "summary": "Scottish thinker born in Kirkcaldy and baptised there on 5 June 1723. He taught at the University of Glasgow until 1764, spent years writing An Inquiry into the Nature and Causes of the Wealth of Nations, published in 1776, then served as a customs commissioner in Edinburgh, where he lived until his death in July 1790.",
